Package: DaSHDiagnostic
Type: Package
Title: Database Fingerprinting and Diagnostics for the DaSH Prostate-Cancer Study
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Andrei", "Kiselev", email = "andrei.kiselev@bdmconsulting.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: OHDSI study package that instantiates prostate-cancer treatment and outcome
    cohorts on an OMOP CDM and produces aggregated diagnostics: cohort counts and inclusion
    statistics, temporal baseline characteristics, and incidence-rate / time-to-event safety
    estimates (Kaplan-Meier 3-year cumulative incidence and Poisson incidence rates).
